1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,887
Ever say 'I should go outside'…

2
00:00:03,887 --> 00:00:06,548
and then don't? Same.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,393
Meet StrollCall.

4
00:00:10,393 --> 00:00:12,554
Less planning. More walking.

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,504
Tell it what you want in one sentence,

6
00:00:16,504 --> 00:00:20,465
like 'twenty minutes, quiet streets, coffee at the end.'

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,042
Type it, or just say it.

8
00:00:23,377 --> 00:00:26,140
StrollCall plans a real walk from where you are,

9
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:27,814
and you're out the door.

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,230
Want company? Send one link.

11
00:00:35,461 --> 00:00:38,968
Your friend taps 'I'm in', no app needed.

12
00:00:39,303 --> 00:00:43,007
StrollCall finds a meeting point that's fair by walking time,

13
00:00:43,007 --> 00:00:44,783
so nobody's left waiting,

14
00:00:44,783 --> 00:00:47,246
then plans the walk you'll share.

15
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:53,822
On the way, your walking buddy has your back.

16
00:00:54,157 --> 00:00:56,700
Ask for a coffee stop, a shorter route,

17
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,466
or what's nearby.

18
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,829
For homebodies, busy students,

19
00:01:04,829 --> 00:01:07,919
and friends who keep saying 'we should hang out.'

20
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:14,620
Scan the code and take your first walk today.

21
00:01:14,955 --> 00:01:16,408
StrollCall.
